{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":162,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1906875,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1446499173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1445981636,"LastPoster":{"Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1446499173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1906875,"PostDate":1445981636,"PostContent":"Trying to decide if it is worth the cost ... if you had it, was it worth it? \u00a0If you didn't, did...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426931385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1446499173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.65.74.207","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76ad0fdaa6a3a70e892c48804195705f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Trying to decide if it is worth the cost ... if you had it, was it worth it? &amp;nbsp;If you didn&#039;t, did it feel awkward and quiet?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906875,"PostDate":1445981636,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Trying to decide if it is worth the cost ... if you had it, was it worth it? \u00a0If you didn't, did it feel awkward and quiet?<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426931385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1446499173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eff051a177af4a0c6aadf49f44c90bec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I found the recent NOW Larimar threaad - maybe you can read through it and see if there are opinions or not. I&#039;m not familiar with the resort, sorry. I&#039;m sure there are other ladies that will chime in with information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906948,"PostDate":1446147813,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I found the recent NOW Larimar threaad - maybe you can read through it and see if there are opinions or not. I'm not familiar with the resort, sorry. I'm sure there are other ladies that will chime in with information.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...w-larimar-2015\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.65.74.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e44d86ee8e61c7e9eed57c490fd0b0c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1906948\" timestamp=\"1446162213\"]\nI found the recent NOW Larimar threaad - maybe you can read through it and see if there are opinions or not. I&#039;m not familiar with the resort, sorry. I&#039;m sure there are other ladies that will chime in with information.\n\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/[\/url][\/quote]Yes - have already done that. Thanks.","Attachments":[],"Id":1906957,"PostDate":1446163212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 29 October 2015 - 07:43 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I found the recent NOW Larimar threaad - maybe you can read through it and see if there are opinions or not. I'm not familiar with the resort, sorry. I'm sure there are other ladies that will chime in with information.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77311-now-larimar-2015\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...w-larimar-2015\/<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yes - have already done that. Thanks.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426931385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1446499173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.98.67.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"609f8df630a11fdd841bfda2cd7b8b98","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We just got back from having our wedding at the Now Larimar. (It was amazing by the way) We rented the sound equipment for the cocktail hour and it was only $100. We downloaded some music back home and made a playlist for the cocktail hour just to make things easy. Hope this helps :) If you have any other questions about the resort\/weddings there I&#039;d be happy to answer them too :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906985,"PostDate":1446240408,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We just got back from having our wedding at the Now Larimar. (It was amazing by the way) We rented the sound equipment for the cocktail hour and it was only $100. We downloaded some music back home and made a playlist for the cocktail hour just to make things easy. Hope this helps <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> If you have any other questions about the resort\/weddings there I'd be happy to answer them too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nursek84@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.134.233","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405543929,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kimbelina","Id":279046,"Name":"kimbelina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.65.74.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73e2b53912b623b67b62282dccb53d48","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kimbelina\" post=\"1906985\" timestamp=\"1446254808\"]\nWe just got back from having our wedding at the Now Larimar. (It was amazing by the way) We rented the sound equipment for the cocktail hour and it was only $100. We downloaded some music back home and made a playlist for the cocktail hour just to make things easy. Hope this helps :) If you have any other questions about the resort\/weddings there I&#039;d be happy to answer them too :)[\/quote]Awesome - thank you!  I have tons of questions, but I won&#039;t bombard you :) \nCongratulations!","Attachments":[],"Id":1906991,"PostDate":1446294908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kimbelina, on 30 October 2015 - 09:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We just got back from having our wedding at the Now Larimar. (It was amazing by the way) We rented the sound equipment for the cocktail hour and it was only $100. We downloaded some music back home and made a playlist for the cocktail hour just to make things easy. Hope this helps <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> If you have any other questions about the resort\/weddings there I'd be happy to answer them too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Awesome - thank you! \u00a0I have tons of questions, but I won't bombard you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426931385,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1446499173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79686","Title":"Now Larimar - Did You Have Cocktail Hour Music?","LastPostDate":1446294908},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
