 url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> Here's my dress!!\u00a0 We're getting married at the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay, Jamaica in 2 and a half weeks, can't wait!!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428578983,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb9a930a8fa1cf0dc3006031ec51f28c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Soon2beMrsJ\" post=\"1892382\" timestamp=\"1428523700\"]\n@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"] Here&#039;s my dress!!  We&#039;re getting married at the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay, Jamaica in 2 and a half weeks, can&#039;t wait!!!!  :)[\/quote]\nOh that&#039;s so pretty!! And it looks perfect for Jamaica! Your date is so close!! We were married in Jamaica 3 and a half years ago and fell in love with the island. Hoping a trip back will be in the cards sometime. We&#039;ve tried twice and it has bombed both times so we&#039;ll have to see what happens.\n\nGood luck! Hope you post a review and pics when you get back!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892448,"PostDate":1428538094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2beMrsJ, on 08 April 2015 - 04:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a> Here's my dress!!\u00a0 We're getting married at the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay, Jamaica in 2 and a half weeks, can't wait!!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh that's so pretty!! And it looks perfect for Jamaica! Your date is so close!! We were married in Jamaica 3 and a half years ago and fell in love with the island. Hoping a trip back will be in the cards sometime. We've tried twice and it has bombed both times so we'll have to see what happens.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck! Hope you post a review and pics when you get back!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Mode