{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.222.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09c6f09aa29c62a30571c90f427b7bd1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JennyZ\" post=\"1876064\" timestamp=\"1413605982\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] - WOOHOO! 3 months! Down to the crunch time girl!!!  :D  All of my guests need to put a $250 deposit down with our travel agency by December 2014 in order to get the early booking bonus we received, otherwise they&#039;ll be paying at least $200 per person more than the deal we have. A lot aren&#039;t really getting this and think they&#039;ll find better deals themselves.... I try to remind myself not to stress about not knowing who&#039;s coming (especially so far away from the wedding date) but how are you suppose to plan your budget\/make all these bags\/order supplies, when so many people wait last minute?! &amp;lt;_&amp;lt;[\/quote]our guests never found a better price:) most of ours booked in the last couple days. Just send reminders a couple weeks before it ends! We only had one couple book alone but for a good reason!! It&#039;s stressful. I lost sleep but it all works out :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1876065,"PostDate":1413592037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JennyZ, on 18 October 2014 - 12:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> - WOOHOO! 3 months! Down to the crunch time girl!!!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>  All of my guests need to put a $250 deposit down with our travel agency by December 2014 in order to get the early booking bonus we received, otherwise they'll be paying <span>at least<\/span> $200 per person more than the deal we have. A lot aren't really getting this and think they'll find better deals themselves.... I try to remind myself not to stress about not knowing who's coming (especially so far away from the wedding date) but how are you suppose to plan your budget\/make all these bags\/order supplies, when so many people wait last minute?! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/dry.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='<_<' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>our guests never found a better price:) most of ours booked in the last couple days. Just send reminders a couple weeks before it ends! We only had one couple book alone but for a good reason!! It's stressful. I lost sleep but it all works out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' 